-- words --
An event of kind goal.add whose payload does not decode names no guard: the store holds a goal.add, written by hand, whose payload carries the unknown field "zz"; hyp status lists it under refused at replay as a fault of its payload alone.
-- run --
HYP_ACTOR=owner hyp status
-- floor: contains --
refused at replay:
-- floor: contains --
ULID: goal.add payload: json: unknown field "zz"
